flowchart LR
    M1[main] --> M2[main]
    M2 -- git switch -c feature --> F1[feature:<br/>commit 1]
    F1 --> F2[feature:<br/>commit 2]
    F2 -- git push --> PR[Pull request<br/>on GitHub]
    PR -- review + approve --> MG[Merge into main]
    M2 --> MG
    MG -- git pull --> M3[Your local main<br/>updated]
